{'symbol': 'TEL', 'date': '2021-12-10 06:55:00', 'title': "TE CONNECTIVITY'S BOARD APPROVES RECOMMENDATION TO RAISE ANNUALIZED DIVIDEND TO $2.24 PER SHARE", 'text': "SCHAFFHAUSEN, SWITZERLAND, DEC. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TE CONNECTIVITY LTD. (NYSE: TEL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A RECOMMENDATION TO INCREASE THE COMPANY'S QUARTERLY DIVIDEND FROM $0.50 TO $0.56 PER SHARE, FOR THE FOUR FISCAL QUARTERS STARTING IN APRIL 2022, THE BEGINNING OF THE THIRD FISCAL QUARTER."}